{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "67aa918d767aa29016f542d0cf6eb079f50cdb9f37f62d5ee7e4dd2b67cf5ed0", "ja": "暴力", "zh": "暴力", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "25b72b795b6eccb4ce94a5e7fbb0571785f2c5cd8408825996f27d44ffa96e2f", "ja": "新ヒーローチーム『ジェネシス』所属の紬は\n任務中にデストルドーのエレナに襲われ、\n仲間のジュリアに助けられる。一方その頃、\n極東軍の宇宙基地が『特務機関ネメシス』と\n名乗る者達によって、襲撃される。", "zh": "䌷隶属于新英雄小队『Genesis』，\n她在执行任务时受到死欲成员艾琳娜的攻击，\n而后在伙伴茱莉亚的协助下脱险。另一方面，\n远东军的太空基地也遭到袭击，\n对方自称『特务机构Nemesis』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8a466a90d11758fa7ec282d6298963ce7c7cdcc1a207bb307d9509d89199e52c", "ja": "ぐっ！？　うっ、ああっ……。\nデストルドー、貴様っ……！", "zh": "唔！？呜、啊啊……！\n死欲……你这家伙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "dff9949dcc684d1da5723a569b6d361362312b93ff1c341e86acf19daac84bf8", "ja": "イェーイ♪　これでこの町は、\nワタシたちデストルドーのものだネ！", "zh": "耶～♪如此一来，这座城市\n就归我们死欲所有了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "349d72bea5e6625d955a3ccad856313fa29d0cb460a47376be94c4ec57e44b22", "ja": "それじゃ、次のサンバで、トドメをさしちゃうヨ～！", "zh": "那么，就用接下来这支森巴送你上路吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1604ac82b475f13157394eaef650c493db1577c650933df1b8374b35c8032b19", "ja": "くっ……！", "zh": "呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "7983482888d63a5d127f58084c6ea23ee8e2927f4de7aeec8b8f54e20eb7b468", "ja": "待ちな！　ウチらの仲間を、返してもらおうか！\n……食らえっ、ダイナマイト・ブロー！", "zh": "你休想！把我们的伙伴还来！\n……接招吧，炸弹重击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1006_se", "source_sha256": "a05fe954e4f554c87d47c9f48aa1a6d28758fd11bc7585c59104146a7d0abfc7", "ja": "ドッカーーーーーン！", "zh": "轰隆────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "eab034ecc278f09e6871a1c1559173c3daad7dde9aaa429fd61e4a7a6c3c8e03", "ja": "ワーオ！　どこからダイナマイトが出てきたノ！？\nくっ、ここは引くネ！　サンバの時間は終わりだヨ～！", "zh": "哇～！你从哪拿出炸弹的！？\n唔，这下只好撤退了！森巴的时间到此为止～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "b4bd664d34dd91ee7c05c1d38deff95b221e89656de83df4d80a8b480e691b15", "ja": "あっ、待て！　……チッ、逃げ足の速いヤツめ。\nムギ、大丈夫か！？", "zh": "啊，站住！\n……啧，溜得还真快。䌷，你没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2c8f01f1d36c2df09d0d8b4c6f3569bd133e2bbcbb96dadb3eee17b11cee0696", "ja": "は、はい。どうにか……。\nありがとう、ジュリア。", "zh": "还、还可以，勉强还撑得住……\n谢谢你，茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "7458b2d4edd6436f2567a5882d8e8e275f389d749fb1e049ad2070e9f08790c1", "ja": "ったく、しっかりしろよな。\nムギはウチらのチームの、期待の星なんだからさ。", "zh": "真是的，振作一点。\n䌷，你可是我们队上备受期待的新星啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "54d59eba7653f2b9baa5fd0116983367cdbcf98ca15ca383e69529290057b1c2", "ja": "もっと自信持てって。ムギの潜在能力……キネティック\nパワーは、ウチらの中でもピカイチ。そうだろ？", "zh": "多点自信啦，䌷的潜能……你的动能威力\n在我们之中可是数一数二耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e964dc35824ec53c2267dc9381ada9ac199774da99505805427e553f9ffa8f22", "ja": "わ、私はまだ、うまく力を使えないし……。\nジュリアの方が、ずっと実力があると思います。", "zh": "毕、毕竟我目前还无法掌控力量……\n我觉得茱莉亚比我厉害多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "94080bf0423def6563323730c208b5f592950a658d70ea294a7f6bbc1cd832f7", "ja": "あっ、ジュリアとつむぎだ！\nおーい、りつこー！　こっちにいたぞ～！", "zh": "啊，是茱莉亚和䌷！\n喂──！律子──！她们在这里～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "1f5a973a24fd5f2d7b345eb15d4d5dab6a424e3f5be634950ebddf3dfe29938f", "ja": "こら、ジェットウルフ！　作戦行動中は\nコードネームで呼びなさいって言ってるでしょ？", "zh": "喂，喷射野狼！不是说了在执行作战时\n要用代号来称呼彼此吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "01206e1a965c1b901df554db072207d2aad5c647d4761d146eaf624368c14b34", "ja": "ふたりとも、大丈夫だったー？\nすごい音がしたぞ！", "zh": "你们两个没事吧～？\n刚才的巨响真吓人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "4c6d37887f02bd143c60bd936f7edcc8ed20247476158ccb5bdae643f3afe239", "ja": "ああ、デストルドーを見つけたもんでね。\nだが逃げられちまったよ。悪いな。", "zh": "嗯，我刚发现死欲想攻击，才弄出那阵声响。\n但还是被她逃掉了，抱歉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "66e8bb8504a04ea520c338806c965401fe23e9af19984197aa962c7adefb0eac", "ja": "じゃあふたりだけで、デストルドーを\n追っぱらっちゃったの！？　すごい！", "zh": "所以你们两个只靠自己\n就赶跑死欲了！？真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "28b37f4feb7ba89cc2e2ac6af9392bd5a022043bdb59364dd9a45c9001fad015", "ja": "さすが、マイティセーラーズ期待の新チーム、\n『ジェネシス』の二人ね。", "zh": "两位真不愧是『Mighty Sailors』备受期待的新生小队\n──『Genesis』的一员呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "58d979f77f72d09b7269c5013f8507ff2c8f56974ca8b6b08f6c85bd7fd6dd23", "ja": "エースのジュリアにエージェント兼ヒーローの茜。\nそれにニューヒーロー、紬！　ふふっ、頼もしいわね！", "zh": "有王牌之称的茱莉亚，以及身兼特务和英雄二职的茜，\n再加上新生英雄──䌷！呵呵，真是可靠呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc267b7973e360eb6c9e39d8308ed3a99d795ad988fb8dce5519ce6ccef0fdfc", "ja": "ストラテジー……私は、みんなや……\nね、姉さんのようには、とても……。", "zh": "战略司令……我实在没办法……\n像、像大家还有姊姊那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "02909d5157d90ba64d3bd4cf2e3ed4db0f6f0a6d4a37008abe93e6a3197e29f5", "ja": "そんなに気にすることないのよ、紬。\n貴女はまだ新人ヒーローなんだし。", "zh": "用不着这么在意，䌷。\n毕竟你目前还是初出茅庐的英雄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "b30ac926c997ad1b3e2b8d68d6f40ad192886b0a498607a09b606cbd141b0056", "ja": "キネティックパワーさえうまく使えるようになれば、\n大丈夫。……さぁ、任務を続けましょう！", "zh": "等你未来掌控了动能威力，\n就没问题了……来，我们继续执行任务吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "0b967bc142f4fd8b1ba52cfebd747728c55fd5059caf4a1010a9aa401b62f36b", "ja": "うん！　早くデストレイピアを見つけなきゃ。\nたまき、がんばって探すぞ～！", "zh": "嗯！得快点找到死欲刺剑才行。\n环会努力找的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1025_kyokutouguntyuuryuubutai", "source_sha256": "4e378718706e3d1b6f1dbfbc410049384b93c262ed6ea3b529e4248cd45390c2", "ja": "『極東宇宙基地、駐留部隊より……敵は少数！\nこれより、一斉掃射で仕留める。……撃てーっ！』", "zh": "『远东太空基地驻军报告……敌人数量不多！\n接下来以全面扫射收拾对方……开火──！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1026_se", "source_sha256": "91fe47030fd7cb1ae8f7319ab1b4752731f7c193fc1ae11284e1587f4b0e84fb", "ja": "ドゴーン！　ドドーンッ！　ズドーン！！", "zh": "砰！咻──砰！轰隆！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "02d6ef1522658b718aaece8ad8df5d8bbf5165c284755b10ef12e7f69b4b2b77", "ja": "閣下。敵は、想定以上の兵力のようです。\nここはやはり、援軍を。", "zh": "阁下，敌人的兵力超出我们的预估。\n我们还是求援吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "3313ca4bf72ad4191dedf21e36f17ab5d0223bcf28399bf6a97d3a7c55aeef08", "ja": "シホ。その発言は、このデストサーベルの真価を、\n私では到底引き出せないと考えての事か？", "zh": "志保，你这么说，是觉得我没办法让\n这把死欲军刀发挥出真本事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "c91cc9f9434c38a14e1e31212d5919e9f70ad659de2a5dba9b0e28f2e7b81f01", "ja": "いえ。決して、そのようなことはありません。\nただ閣下の御身に、万が一の事があったらと。", "zh": "不，属下万万不敢。\n属下只是担心阁下的安危，深怕有个万一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "404f7d96323dc20402d00d7dae00d988738c19212264b95b49334fb6dbdcfc06", "ja": "必要ない。この体がどの程度使えるのか、\n少し見ておきたいだけだ。……実戦は久しぶりだしな。", "zh": "无须担心，我只是想看看这具躯体\n究竟有多少能耐……而且也很久没有实战了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "9de6a14dadecbeafd607f528199d119a128a1c988e3a70d212e418fcfd09ff1c", "ja": "はあああぁっ！！", "zh": "喝啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1032_se", "source_sha256": "e7864d861edbc53c3fe075d81d491587acdc21d438584f896de50afdccae79a9", "ja": "ヴンッ！！", "zh": "轰！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1033_se", "source_sha256": "7d5cb145084f3bff1bd50f35936410277c8d99efcaca3a8781989dbe2f597d23", "ja": "ズガガガガガーーーーン！！！", "zh": "咻砰砰砰砰砰────！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "3cf389d023bf3d338ffbda05503ec98d2181faabe311c1e884dcdf9ae865b186", "ja": "たった一振りで、全部隊を……！？\nさすがは『特務機関ネメシス』総帥……いや……。", "zh": "一刀就让敌方部队全灭了……！？\n真不愧是『特务机构Nemesis』总帅……不……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "fbec524c2cbf1ab4ed8d44bce1d467e82f7fcd6f49d5db8ad178a629ff9f9874", "ja": "へえ……それが『歌織』の力ってわけか。\nすごいじゃないか。", "zh": "哦……那就是『歌织』的力量啊，\n还挺厉害的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "bca172031ebf94854e3f26659750b90f0a2c669d1f2104f796c0c3b18eca4bc3", "ja": "っ！？　『黒髪』……！", "zh": "唔！？『黑发』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "695bf33921e82e53966afab5e67f0a1a0fd5ea5d08f560bdaaed86b2a0bf60e1", "ja": "やあ、シホ。ところで、\n総帥を最前線に立たせておいて、君は出ないのかい？", "zh": "嗨，志保。\n是说总帅都亲上前线了，你不用出击吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "7f32f8c908e961fef50e2815ae497ceebd1fbefe4bb50e14baf37be51e09358e", "ja": "……私にはデストルドー本部より預かった作戦が\nありますから。勝手な行動は取れません。", "zh": "……我还有死欲总部下达的作战要执行，\n不能擅离岗位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "1cb35aaa872b2ef3eb0e4b439f3632e1b45089bbb77051ea43a41633a311115c", "ja": "マコト。\nそちらはもう終わったのか？", "zh": "真，\n你那边已经结束了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "f24c968afe210155a4b76176ac3d8b46ce1d4308e853cfe21d08be90e65b9c31", "ja": "ああ、増援は全て片付けた。\nなんだか退屈な相手だったよ。", "zh": "是啊，援军都收拾掉了。\n打起来还真是没劲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_01_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "97b1a4da92433f512818df447d5e3c918c1d6f4e087771edbb9ba8334677e4ae", "ja": "ご苦労だった。……では、始めるとしようか。\n我ら『特務機関ネメシス』の手による……終末を。", "zh": "辛苦了……那就开始动手吧，\n让我们『特务机构Nemesis』……来毁灭这个世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
